  "subdivision_of_building": "The pre-application relates to a change of use of the unit to Sui Generis to operate a dog grooming and daycare business. No external changes are proposed though the applicant has explained they may seek to install a replacement full-glass frontage at a later date, which would require planning permission as this would alter the front elevation of the building facing a public highway, regardless if this sits behind roller shutters.\n\nThe business would operate under a model that involves taking care of dogs mostly during standard\nworking hours, taking them for walks during the day in the nearby area and general grooming. A small\nretail offering is proposed, which would involve the selling of goods relating to the business only (e.g. pet\ntreats, collars, leads), therefore officers consider this element to be only ancillary to the",
